# A Hackl axe passes a lying Kurgast (D-097: lying = Pass, a harmless deck
# chair): the flow of bad_ischl_hackl_axes into Bad Ischl as Hackl; Resi
# stomps Kurgast #1 (100, „Kurruhe!"), walks back left past his chair and
# throws an axe to the left from right beside it (frame 3077): the axe
# flies through the chair, gives no points and he keeps resting in it.
# She stays beside the chair, so when he gets up after his rest and wake
# he walks into her (Hurt, Hackl -> Zuckerschock): he was never knocked
# off. The route's second station is St. Gilgen's slot (`stage=` names
# the station, as in flow_hackl_carry_over).
level  = hackl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
route  = hackl bad_ischl
expect = deaths=0 event=Stomped event=HacklThrown event=Hurt score=6950
expect = state=playing stage=st_gilgen power=big
